// Release builds use the same ignored secret file that CI creates immediately
// before archiving. Keeping this connection in a normal Xcode configuration is
// simpler and more reliable than hoping a command-line flag wins over a target
// setting with the same name.
//
// The optional include keeps ordinary secret-free Release builds possible for
// static analysis and UI-test fixtures. A live archive must provide the ignored
// `Secrets.xcconfig` file, and the TestFlight workflow checks that its value is
// not empty before Fastlane starts.
NEWS_API_KEY =
#include? "Secrets.xcconfig"
